# Deny-by-default: ignore everything, then explicitly allow the files
# that actually belong in this AUR package repo. This keeps stray build
# artifacts (pkg/, src/, debtap/, downloaded .deb/.pkg.tar.zst, etc.)
# from ever being accidentally committed.
*

!/.gitignore
!/PKGBUILD
!/.SRCINFO
!/digitalwatchdog-client.install
